# Copy to .env (gitignored) on hosts that serve a domain set different from
# this repo's default (letatel.com + dicefight.online, same server). Only
# needed for a host serving dicefight.online alone -- see docker-compose.yml's
# nginx service and README.md's "Deploy" section.
#
# NGINX_SERVER_NAMES=dicefight.online
# NGINX_CERT_NAME=dicefight.online
